  "full_name": "servicetitan/stl.fusion",
  "description": "Build real-time apps (Blazor included) with less than 1% of extra code responsible for real-time updates. Host 10-1000x faster APIs relying on transparent and nearly 100% consistent caching. We call it DREAM, or Distributed REActive Memoization, and it's here to turn real-time on!",
  "description_ja": "リアルタイム更新に必要な追加コードを 1% 未満に抑えてリアルタイムアプリ（Blazor 含む）を構築。透明性が高くほぼ 100% 一貫したキャッシュにより、10〜1000 倍高速な API をホスト。これを DREAM（Distributed REActive Memoization）と呼び、リアルタイムを現実にします！",
